msgid ""
"`Wikipedia's entry on image histograms <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Image_histogram>`_."
msgstr ""
"`Irudien histogramei buruzko Wikipediako sarrera <https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/Image_histogram>`_."

